{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（2日）早上9時許，尖沙咀彌敦道83至97號華源大廈一名男子報案稱遇劫受傷。警方到場調查，事主稱被掠去手提電話和銀包，他頭部受傷，由救護車送往伊利沙伯醫院治理，案件列襲擊致身體受傷案調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171773350616371200367214.jpeg/LvNdPpcirx1Iy4sdg_3kswsYMzGj5gLwumCX97pgl_c\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到產調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171773353489600512805273.jpeg/c-4vbPuiVSQL-zeCMqWjimnbX-whSaeJnBO9_JwTvfw\"/><figcaption>警員到產調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是華源大廈。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171773347713781760942761.jpeg/oyRey2dObNvvrSK5yL8vTKVEgk1U5P4R01ykitNcpIo\"/><figcaption>現場是華源大廈。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主送院治理。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260902/1171773356216029184438901.jpeg/MbNqsOQ7rKSAdyb8S3noWRJHrOCMOadBGwJj0D4CY9A\"/><figcaption>事主送院治理。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T03:03:53.718200+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}